33/blog.github.io/refs/heads/main/static/avatar.jpg", "createdDate": "2025-02-12", "dateLabelColor": "#0969da"}, "P17": {"htmlDir": "docs/post/Windows-zi-yong-jiao-ben.html", "labels": ["windows"], "postTitle": "Windows\u81ea\u7528\u811a\u672c", "postUrl": "post/Windows-zi-yong-jiao-ben.html", "postSourceUrl": "https://github.com/sephiroth233/blog.github.io/issues/17", "commentNum": 0, "wordCount": 1564, "description": "### 1.Windows\u89e3\u9664\u672c\u5730\u56de\u73af\u9650\u5236\uff1a\n\u5728Powershell\u4e2d\u8f93\u5165\uff1a\n\n```\n Get-ChildItem -Path Registry::'HKCU\\Software\\Classes\\Local Settings\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\AppContainer\\Mappings\\' -name | ForEach-Object {CheckNetIsolation.exe LoopbackExempt -a -p='$_'} \n```\n\n### 2.Winget\u5b89\u88c5\u6307\u4ee4\uff1a\n\n```\n$progressPreference = 'silentlyContinue'\nWrite-Host 'Installing WinGet PowerShell module from PSGallery...'\nInstall-PackageProvider -Name NuGet -Force | Out-Null\nInstall-Module -Name Microsoft.WinGet.Client -Force -Repository PSGallery | Out-Null\nWrite-Host 'Using Repair-WinGetPackageManager cmdlet to bootstrap WinGet...'\nRepair-WinGetPackageManager\nWrite-Host 'Done.'\n```\n\n### 3.\u5e38\u7528\u8f6f\u4ef6\u5b89\u88c5\uff1a\n\n\u65e5\u5e38\u8f6f\u4ef6\uff1a\n\n```\nwinget install --id Tencent.WeChat.Universal -e\nwinget install --id Tencent.WeType -e\nwinget install --id 7zip.7zip -e\nwinget install --id Git.Git -e\nwinget install --id Google.Chrome -e\nwinget install --id Termius.Termius -e\nwinget install Notepad--\nwinget install --id appmakes.Typora -e\nwinget install --id voidtools.Everything -e\nwinget install --id JetBrains.Toolbox -e\nwinget install --id Telegram.TelegramDesktop -e\nwinget install --id Microsoft.VisualStudioCode -e\nwinget install --id GeekUninstaller.GeekUninstaller -e\n```\n\nWindows  AI \u65f6\u4ee3\u5de5\u5177\uff1a\n\n```\n# \u7ec8\u7aef\u3001Shell\u3001\u542f\u52a8\u5668\nwinget install --id Microsoft.WindowsTerminal -e\nwinget install --id Microsoft.PowerShell -e\n\n# Linux-like \u547d\u4ee4\u884c\u4f53\u9a8c\nwinget install --id Microsoft.WSL -e\nwinget install --id Microsoft.Coreutils -e\nwinget install --id Microsoft.Edit -e\n\n```\n\nWSL \u521d\u59cb\u5316\uff1a\n\n```\nwsl --install\nwsl --update\nwsl --set-default-version 2\n```\n\u3002", "top": 0, "createdAt": 1739944830, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "ogImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sephiroth233/blog.github.io/refs/heads/main/static/avatar.jpg", "createdDate": "2025-02-19", "dateLabelColor": "#0969da"}, "P25": {"htmlDir": "docs/post/reinstall-yi-jian- VPS -zhong-zhuang-jiao-ben.html", "labels": ["linux"], "postTitle": "reinstall\u4e00\u952e VPS \u91cd\u88c5\u811a\u672c", "postUrl": "post/reinstall-yi-jian-%20VPS%20-zhong-zhuang-jiao-ben.html", "postSourceUrl": "https://github.com/sephiroth233/blog.github.io/issues/25", "commentNum": 0, "wordCount": 1442, "description": "# reinstall\u4e00\u952e VPS \u91cd\u88c5\u811a\u672c\n\n\u9879\u76ee\u5730\u5740\uff1ahttps://github.com/bin456789/reinstall\n\n## \u7b80\u4ecb\n\n`reinstall` \u662f\u4e00\u952e DD/\u91cd\u88c5\u7cfb\u7edf\u811a\u672c\uff0c\u652f\u6301\u5728 VPS / \u72ec\u670d\u4e0a\u91cd\u88c5\u5230\u4e3b\u6d41 Linux \u53d1\u884c\u7248\u548c Windows\uff0c\u5168\u7a0b\u81ea\u52a8\u8bc6\u522b\u786c\u76d8\u3001\u81ea\u52a8\u914d\u7f6e\u7f51\u7edc\u3002", "top": 0, "createdAt": 1780711997, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "ogImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sephiroth233/blog.github.io/refs/heads/main/static/avatar.jpg", "createdDate": "2026-06-06", "dateLabelColor": "#1f883d"}}, "singeListJson": {}, "labelColorDict": {"ai": "#0366d6", "linux": "#31E169", "mac": "#093b5b", "windows": "#b60205", "\u968f\u7b14": "#2698DA"}, "displayTitle": "lang", "faviconUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sephiroth233/blog.github.io/refs/heads/main/static/avatar.jpg", "ogImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sephiroth233/blog.github.io/refs/heads/main/